        "message": "Add a Playwright smoke suite for the learner-to-teacher journey\n\nOne browser test registers a new account, joins a course from the\ncatalogue, clears the first node through the quiz, then signs in as the\ninstructor and finds the learner on the roster at 1/6 cleared. This is\nthe only check that drives the real pages against the real API, so it\ncatches wiring regressions that unit and integration tests miss.\n\nThe suite gets its own CI job with a throwaway database and a running\njar; vitest is told to leave e2e/ alone.",
